1
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:31,919
=Remnants of Gold=

2
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:34,478
(Adapted from Gu Long's
"Flying Eagle over the Great Land")

3
00:01:34,479 --> 00:01:37,540
(The main characters
in this drama are fictional)

4
00:01:38,180 --> 00:01:40,500
=Episode 8=

5
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:42,919
You poisoned an entire street,

6
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:44,960
but it has no effect

7
00:02:45,759 --> 00:02:46,520
on me.

8
00:02:48,479 --> 00:02:49,360
It worked.

9
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:52,240
Your men ended up killing each other.

10
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:56,159
I still have two helpers.

11
00:02:58,280 --> 00:02:59,960
Where are the guardians of the gold?

12
00:03:01,479 --> 00:03:02,759
I can take you straight

13
00:03:02,759 --> 00:03:04,120
to the 300,000 taels of gold.

14
00:03:04,639 --> 00:03:06,680
You know where the gold is?

15
00:03:07,759 --> 00:03:08,319
Of course.

16
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:09,240
Where?

17
00:03:17,319 --> 00:03:18,080
Hey.

18
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:28,479
Ghost Couple,

19
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:31,400
you want the 300,000
taels of gold, too, right?

20
00:03:32,639 --> 00:03:33,639
We do.

21
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:36,520
You wretched woman.

22
00:03:37,439 --> 00:03:38,560
Either

23
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:40,439
Ghost Couple

24
00:03:40,599 --> 00:03:41,759
kills me,

25
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,319
or

26
00:03:43,479 --> 00:03:44,919
I kill them.

27
00:03:45,479 --> 00:03:46,280
Is that so?

28
00:04:01,879 --> 00:04:04,680
How did you find out
where the gold was hidden?

29
00:04:06,439 --> 00:04:08,280
That's a bit too easy.

30
00:04:09,199 --> 00:04:10,400
It wasn't easy for you,

31
00:04:11,479 --> 00:04:12,719
but it was very easy for me.

32
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,960
Why else did you invite me back?

33
00:04:20,199 --> 00:04:21,720
How can I trust you?

34
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:26,120
What you said
at Heisong Post made sense.

35
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:30,480
The 27 members of my family
can't come back to life.

36
00:04:31,424 --> 00:04:33,120
We might as well
make a fortune together.

37
00:04:33,728 --> 00:04:35,240
However, if revenge isn't taken,

38
00:04:35,399 --> 00:04:36,480
my anger won't subside.

39
00:04:37,319 --> 00:04:39,360
Either you die, or they die.

40
00:04:39,839 --> 00:04:41,279
I will take half

41
00:04:42,752 --> 00:04:44,416
of the 300,000 taels of gold.

42
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,439
That's too much.

43
00:04:50,759 --> 00:04:52,800
I still don't trust you.

44
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,680
Once greed takes hold of your heart,

45
00:04:55,879 --> 00:04:56,759
you will believe it.

46
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:23,879
I've wanted to kill you for a long time.

47
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:27,240
You dare to kill us?

48
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:30,480
Why wouldn't I dare?

49
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:35,040
Universal Antidote.

50
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:49,480
Fang.

51
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:56,079
I'm pouring it.

52
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:04,000
Why?

53
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,519
You still have residual poison in you.

54
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,240
Close your eyes.

55
00:06:39,639 --> 00:06:40,519
Don't move.

56
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:47,759
I'll go find Luyao.

57
00:06:56,639 --> 00:06:57,199
Hey,

58
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:58,680
I let you fight,

59
00:06:58,680 --> 00:06:59,759
and you even hit me?

60
00:07:01,279 --> 00:07:03,519
You were just a feed keeper before.

61
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:05,319
I am a Battalion Commander.

62
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:09,399
Over these 30 years,
you've grown far too bold,

63
00:07:11,279 --> 00:07:13,079
even daring to raise a son.

64
00:07:15,439 --> 00:07:16,439
Without my son,

65
00:07:16,512 --> 00:07:17,870
I wouldn't want to live anyway.

66
00:07:20,319 --> 00:07:21,680
I'm sick of living like this.

67
00:07:25,439 --> 00:07:26,399
What are you afraid of?

68
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:28,000
Move aside.

69
00:07:31,519 --> 00:07:33,560
They are in a hurry to find the gold.

70
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:35,000
Just let them look for it.

71
00:07:35,024 --> 00:07:36,190
If they find it, kill them.

72
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:37,759
If they don't, we drink.

73
00:07:37,824 --> 00:07:40,110
What if the Liangzhou Deputy
Military Commissioner escapes

74
00:07:40,128 --> 00:07:41,160
and brings men back?

75
00:07:43,759 --> 00:07:45,439
You and Seventeen leave today.

76
00:07:45,904 --> 00:07:47,808
Abandon the Lieyang Well
camel-horse market.

77
00:07:50,879 --> 00:07:51,879
Where is Seventeen?

78
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:11,399
Fang?

79
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:12,879
Hou.

80
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:16,639
You're not dead yet.

81
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:19,040
I'm so glad.

82
00:08:39,559 --> 00:08:40,600
Dear!

83
00:09:31,679 --> 00:09:33,240
Wretched woman,

84
00:09:34,279 --> 00:09:35,200
wait for me.

85
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:36,559
It'll be done soon.

86
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:38,600
Now, there's only one of you,

87
00:09:39,680 --> 00:09:40,840
but there are two of us.

88
00:09:42,639 --> 00:09:43,840
Two?

89
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:50,559
Just like we agreed,

90
00:09:51,399 --> 00:09:52,679
I have killed them.

91
00:09:53,159 --> 00:09:54,559
So, let's make a fortune together.

92
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:00,720
For three hundred thousand taels,

93
00:10:01,519 --> 00:10:02,360
half for you,

94
00:10:02,519 --> 00:10:03,360
and half for me.

95
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:06,039
You are pitiful.

96
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:10,919
Wait for me.

97
00:10:36,519 --> 00:10:38,399
Who is this kid?

98
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:40,080
We've met.

99
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,639
Last time, you went mad,

100
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,720
so I splashed a bucket of water on you.

101
00:10:43,856 --> 00:10:44,720
Where's the spear?

102
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:48,639
It's on the horse outside.

103
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:49,960
You can't lose the spear.

104
00:10:50,759 --> 00:10:51,759
Go fetch two horses.

105
00:10:52,519 --> 00:10:53,159
Deputy.

106
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:54,120
Deputy!

107
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:57,344
There's a bunch
of bandits on the street.

108
00:10:58,240 --> 00:11:00,200
Miss Zhang and Pingping
are still outside.

109
00:11:01,559 --> 00:11:02,519
Who's Pingping?

110
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:06,000
Pingping...

111
00:11:08,159 --> 00:11:09,919
Do you want to live and get rich,

112
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:11,759
or do you want to die?

113
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:12,919
Go die.

114
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:57,279
Can we just talk properly?

115
00:11:59,919 --> 00:12:00,720
Sure.

116
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:15,919
Miss Zhang,

117
00:12:16,480 --> 00:12:17,960
have you made up your mind?

118
00:12:50,080 --> 00:12:52,559
You're the top official of Liangzhou,

119
00:12:53,159 --> 00:12:55,039
yet you colluded with Tie Futu

120
00:12:55,279 --> 00:12:57,639
to poison Zhang Luyao's family to death.

121
00:12:58,200 --> 00:12:59,799
You villain.

122
00:13:00,039 --> 00:13:01,440
Don't you feel any guilt?

123
00:13:02,679 --> 00:13:03,440
Deputy,

124
00:13:04,279 --> 00:13:05,559
what is he talking about?

125
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:07,000
Hey,

126
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:09,639
you're one of his men?

127
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:11,159
Go fetch two horses.

128
00:13:11,720 --> 00:13:12,399
Hou,

129
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:14,879
what's going on?

130
00:13:15,679 --> 00:13:16,360
Father.

131
00:13:18,759 --> 00:13:20,240
Now, you can call me Father.

132
00:13:21,279 --> 00:13:22,080
Deputy,

133
00:13:22,879 --> 00:13:23,679
tell me.

134
00:13:24,200 --> 00:13:25,120
What is it?

135
00:13:28,799 --> 00:13:30,960
Where are the 300,000 taels
of gold hidden?

136
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:33,879
You shouldn't ask him.

137
00:13:34,120 --> 00:13:35,519
You should ask me.

138
00:13:41,159 --> 00:13:42,120
Do you have a son?

139
00:13:44,519 --> 00:13:47,120
Guardians of the gold
only have brothers,

140
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:48,320
no sons.

141
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:50,320
You have a son?

142
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:51,840
Yes.

143
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:54,000
Let me ask you.

144
00:13:55,879 --> 00:13:57,720
Your blade
cuts through iron like butter,

145
00:13:59,440 --> 00:14:01,279
but my soft armor is indestructible.

146
00:14:10,919 --> 00:14:12,639
Killing you two would be child's play!

147
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:21,519
We both know what the situation is now.

148
00:14:22,440 --> 00:14:23,720
Cut the nonsense.

149
00:14:25,639 --> 00:14:26,879
The outside is full of my men.

150
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:28,279
If Tie Futu comes in,

151
00:14:28,279 --> 00:14:30,279
he won't be as polite as I am.

152
00:14:31,039 --> 00:14:32,200
To be honest,

153
00:14:32,879 --> 00:14:34,240
your son's throat

154
00:14:35,039 --> 00:14:35,960
wouldn't be nicked.

155
00:14:36,399 --> 00:14:38,000
I'm telling you the truth

156
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:41,320
about where the gold is hidden.

157
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:56,600
Ask you?

158
00:14:57,159 --> 00:14:58,039
If you ask,

159
00:14:58,919 --> 00:14:59,960
I'll tell you.

160
00:15:00,360 --> 00:15:01,440
He is his son,

161
00:15:02,159 --> 00:15:03,039
so I'm asking him.

162
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:03,799
Hou,

163
00:15:04,840 --> 00:15:05,960
what's going on?

164
00:15:06,320 --> 00:15:07,759
Where is the gold?

165
00:16:03,159 --> 00:16:04,759
She won't survive.

166
00:16:17,559 --> 00:16:19,000
What do you need gold for?

167
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:21,559
Isn't being alive good enough?

168
00:16:25,240 --> 00:16:26,240
With gold,

169
00:16:29,088 --> 00:16:30,416
life will be even better.

170
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:33,039
Battalion Commander,

171
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:35,080
30 years ago,

172
00:16:35,240 --> 00:16:37,320
our master buried the gold

173
00:16:37,799 --> 00:16:40,039
and said he would return in a season.

174
00:16:40,159 --> 00:16:41,240
The brothers

175
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:43,360
guarded it day after day,

176
00:16:43,519 --> 00:16:45,080
guarding it until now.

177
00:16:45,399 --> 00:16:46,519
The older we get,

178
00:16:46,519 --> 00:16:47,600
the more panicked we feel.

179
00:16:47,600 --> 00:16:48,440
Why?

180
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:49,360
Hou, what's going on?

181
00:16:49,360 --> 00:16:51,120
Our master passed away long ago!

182
00:16:51,120 --> 00:16:53,519
Tell me where the gold is. Where is it?

183
00:16:58,879 --> 00:16:59,919
Battalion Commander,

184
00:17:01,960 --> 00:17:03,480
you won't kill me, will you?

185
00:17:03,759 --> 00:17:05,640
I can end you with a flick of my hand.

186
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:07,599
Hou,

187
00:17:08,440 --> 00:17:09,920
what are you doing?

188
00:17:11,039 --> 00:17:12,799
Keep heading west.

189
00:17:13,359 --> 00:17:14,720
Once you pass Shiquan Fort,

190
00:17:15,839 --> 00:17:17,359
travel for three more days.

191
00:17:18,359 --> 00:17:19,920
The gold is right in...

192
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:27,839
Wusu Sea.

193
00:17:30,039 --> 00:17:31,599
Wusu Sea is so vast.

194
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:33,039
Where exactly is it?

195
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:34,599
Let Seventeen go.

196
00:17:40,640 --> 00:17:42,720
My son and I will take you there.

197
00:17:45,216 --> 00:17:47,056
Tell your father to prepare the horses.

198
00:17:47,799 --> 00:17:48,480
Father,

199
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:50,240
go fetch the horses.

200
00:17:50,440 --> 00:17:51,240
Fang,

201
00:17:52,759 --> 00:17:53,839
are you still obedient?

202
00:17:55,160 --> 00:17:56,079
I am.

203
00:17:56,839 --> 00:17:57,839
Bring your spear.

204
00:18:05,119 --> 00:18:06,039
Luyao,

205
00:18:07,359 --> 00:18:09,799
I saw him again.

206
00:18:12,839 --> 00:18:13,839
Just now,

207
00:18:15,519 --> 00:18:17,319
right up there.

208
00:18:29,200 --> 00:18:30,240
Luyao,

209
00:18:32,519 --> 00:18:34,440
forget about revenge.

210
00:18:38,200 --> 00:18:39,240
Good people

211
00:18:39,640 --> 00:18:41,200
should live long lives.

212
00:18:43,240 --> 00:18:44,160
Luyao...

213
00:18:46,559 --> 00:18:47,640
Run...

214
00:18:49,480 --> 00:18:52,240
Run as far away as you can.

215
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:56,960
There's nowhere left to run.

216
00:18:59,720 --> 00:19:00,920
My father and brothers

217
00:19:02,240 --> 00:19:03,160
must be avenged.

218
00:20:00,839 --> 00:20:02,200
She's dead as a doornail.

219
00:20:20,440 --> 00:20:21,839
You said it yourself

220
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:24,839
that the dead don't come back to life.

221
00:20:25,040 --> 00:20:26,976
We might as well
make a fortune together!

222
00:20:35,799 --> 00:20:36,640
Tell me.

223
00:20:37,559 --> 00:20:38,920
Where is the gold?

224
00:20:50,624 --> 00:20:52,550
Shaanxi Branch
Regional Military Commission.

225
00:20:57,240 --> 00:20:59,720
When the gold was buried 30 years ago,

226
00:21:01,359 --> 00:21:03,160
there was no Commander-in-Chief yet.

227
00:21:08,799 --> 00:21:10,319
You dare play me?

228
00:21:11,559 --> 00:21:13,640
You killed over a dozen of my men,

229
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:17,240
and you still dare to lie to my face?

230
00:21:22,839 --> 00:21:24,079
You're scared.

231
00:21:25,680 --> 00:21:27,279
Even bad guys fear the General?

232
00:21:28,039 --> 00:21:29,119
So you don't dare?

233
00:21:30,559 --> 00:21:32,720
I'm going to kill you.

234
00:21:34,680 --> 00:21:36,720
You killed my father and
brothers and lured me back,

235
00:21:38,279 --> 00:21:40,440
all just to find out
where the gold is, no?

236
00:21:42,079 --> 00:21:43,559
Now that you know,

237
00:21:45,440 --> 00:21:46,559
you can kill me now.

238
00:22:02,880 --> 00:22:03,400
Move.

239
00:22:03,599 --> 00:22:04,079
Move.

240
00:22:24,720 --> 00:22:27,000
Do you really think
I wouldn't dare kill you?

241
00:22:41,039 --> 00:22:43,240
If you want to die,
I'll send you on your way!

242
00:22:52,448 --> 00:22:54,992
What's so special about
the Regional Military Commission Yamen?

243
00:22:56,480 --> 00:22:59,359
There's nowhere under the sun
I wouldn't dare go!

244
00:23:49,880 --> 00:23:51,160
You darned woman,

245
00:23:51,880 --> 00:23:53,440
what are you trying to do?

246
00:24:08,559 --> 00:24:09,200
Forget it.

247
00:24:10,960 --> 00:24:12,759
I'll send you on your way.

248
00:24:16,000 --> 00:24:17,359
Hurry!

249
00:24:17,799 --> 00:24:19,039
Protect the Officer.

250
00:24:26,784 --> 00:24:27,590
You didn't leave?

251
00:24:29,240 --> 00:24:30,400
I knew you wouldn't leave.

252
00:24:30,400 --> 00:24:31,720
You're asking for death.

253
00:24:31,720 --> 00:24:33,640
I'll kill you guys all the same.

254
00:24:33,759 --> 00:24:35,039
Don't let the jerk get away.

255
00:24:35,039 --> 00:24:36,680
- Yes!
- Yes!

256
00:24:48,720 --> 00:24:49,480
Officer Pu.

257
00:24:52,848 --> 00:24:55,200
How dare you kill
an Embroidered Uniform Guard officer?

258
00:24:59,559 --> 00:25:00,279
Go.

259
00:25:02,039 --> 00:25:03,440
Protect the Officer.

260
00:25:03,759 --> 00:25:04,920
Form up!

261
00:25:10,799 --> 00:25:12,880
How dare you, Futu!
Have you lost your mind?

262
00:25:13,000 --> 00:25:14,880
I'm going to kill every last one of you.

263
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:17,519
Kill the jerk!

264
00:25:17,519 --> 00:25:18,720
Did you hear that?

265
00:25:18,720 --> 00:25:20,480
Officer Pu said to kill Tie Futu!

266
00:25:20,480 --> 00:25:22,440
Guys, charge!

267
00:25:22,440 --> 00:25:25,200
- Kill him!
- Kill him!

268
00:25:33,960 --> 00:25:34,759
Kill.

269
00:25:36,920 --> 00:25:37,880
Protect the Officer.

270
00:25:38,440 --> 00:25:39,599
Protect the Officer.

271
00:25:48,359 --> 00:25:49,079
Father.

272
00:25:57,680 --> 00:25:59,000
I haven't let you leave yet.

273
00:25:59,880 --> 00:26:00,519
Fang,

274
00:26:01,160 --> 00:26:01,880
stop him.

275
00:26:04,200 --> 00:26:04,920
Lad,

276
00:26:05,599 --> 00:26:06,640
don't seek death.

277
00:26:06,799 --> 00:26:08,240
This has nothing to do with you.

278
00:26:09,799 --> 00:26:10,480
Bana,

279
00:26:11,279 --> 00:26:12,319
do you still want your son?

280
00:26:23,232 --> 00:26:24,590
Thank you, Battalion Commander,

281
00:26:25,160 --> 00:26:26,240
for considering my son.

282
00:26:27,519 --> 00:26:28,920
Otherwise, the golden bow

283
00:26:28,920 --> 00:26:30,319
would have been drawn long ago.

284
00:26:32,079 --> 00:26:33,079
Battalion Commander,

285
00:26:33,319 --> 00:26:34,920
you may tolerate me for a moment,

286
00:26:35,359 --> 00:26:37,480
but our men won't tolerate me forever.

287
00:26:38,400 --> 00:26:40,920
I want nothing else now.

288
00:26:42,519 --> 00:26:44,480
I just want to be with my son,

289
00:26:44,720 --> 00:26:46,240
taking it one day at a time.

290
00:26:50,400 --> 00:26:51,680
You're asking for death.

291
00:26:51,680 --> 00:26:53,960
I'll show you the power
of divine machinery.

292
00:26:53,960 --> 00:26:54,880
Officer Pu.

293
00:26:54,880 --> 00:26:56,640
Hurry, bring the divine machinery.

294
00:27:14,920 --> 00:27:15,480
Attack.

295
00:27:18,480 --> 00:27:19,079
Good.

296
00:27:24,400 --> 00:27:25,079
Attack.

297
00:27:39,079 --> 00:27:40,359
Don't let the jerk escape!

298
00:27:40,599 --> 00:27:41,119
Attack.

299
00:27:41,480 --> 00:27:42,160
Get him.

300
00:27:42,160 --> 00:27:42,839
Officer Pu.

301
00:27:42,839 --> 00:27:43,960
Attack! Get him!

302
00:27:43,960 --> 00:27:44,880
Mount up!

303
00:27:44,880 --> 00:27:45,920
Don't let him get away.

304
00:27:46,039 --> 00:27:46,720
Mount up!

305
00:27:47,160 --> 00:27:47,680
Hurry.

306
00:27:48,279 --> 00:27:49,400
Hurry up.

307
00:27:50,640 --> 00:27:51,759
- Over there!
- Officer Pu.

308
00:27:53,000 --> 00:27:53,960
Officer Pu.

309
00:27:54,400 --> 00:27:55,440
You...

310
00:27:58,519 --> 00:28:00,119
Are you missing your shots on purpose?

311
00:28:02,039 --> 00:28:03,400
Mount up, hurry.

312
00:28:04,759 --> 00:28:05,400
Officer Pu.

313
00:28:05,400 --> 00:28:06,799
Cut him off up ahead.

314
00:28:32,640 --> 00:28:33,400
Deputy Yu.

315
00:28:35,319 --> 00:28:36,039
Deputy Yu.

316
00:28:36,200 --> 00:28:36,880
Follow me.

317
00:28:38,000 --> 00:28:38,519
Let's go.

318
00:28:39,160 --> 00:28:40,960
You two, keep up with Deputy Yu.

319
00:28:41,880 --> 00:28:42,519
Keep up.

320
00:29:06,359 --> 00:29:07,440
Faster.

321
00:29:07,599 --> 00:29:09,680
Deputy Yu is up ahead. Keep up.

322
00:29:15,279 --> 00:29:16,400
Where is my horse?

323
00:29:31,559 --> 00:29:32,400
Gone?

324
00:29:35,319 --> 00:29:36,240
You darn coroner.

325
00:29:36,799 --> 00:29:38,240
What a traitorous scum.

326
00:29:41,240 --> 00:29:42,599
You are all finished.

327
00:29:45,240 --> 00:29:46,079
You're here, too?

328
00:29:46,400 --> 00:29:47,279
You're here, too?

329
00:30:06,519 --> 00:30:07,440
Leaving so soon?

330
00:30:08,200 --> 00:30:08,799
Yes.

331
00:30:16,119 --> 00:30:17,039
Where are you heading?

332
00:30:18,920 --> 00:30:21,440
Those people took my guy.

333
00:30:23,680 --> 00:30:25,640
So you want to
go after them to save him?

334
00:30:26,440 --> 00:30:27,559
Go after them

335
00:30:28,000 --> 00:30:29,279
to kill him.

336
00:30:35,559 --> 00:30:36,920
Zhang Luyao is still over there.

337
00:30:39,000 --> 00:30:39,640
How is she?

338
00:30:41,088 --> 00:30:42,780
The whole street is
littered with bodies.

339
00:30:43,480 --> 00:30:45,359
We can't just leave
her alone at Lieyang Well.

340
00:31:40,020 --> 00:31:45,660
(Meet first at Shaquan Inn in Ganzhou,
upper room, with gold.)

341
00:32:45,880 --> 00:32:46,599
Deputy Yu,

342
00:32:47,680 --> 00:32:48,640
have a bite.

343
00:33:00,720 --> 00:33:01,720
Give him some, too.

344
00:33:22,880 --> 00:33:23,799
Eat something.

345
00:33:47,279 --> 00:33:48,880
Does my son have food?

346
00:33:50,079 --> 00:33:51,759
Your son has a spear with him,

347
00:33:52,559 --> 00:33:54,200
the fastest spear in Gansu.

348
00:33:57,559 --> 00:33:59,400
As long as I let you see the gold,

349
00:34:00,680 --> 00:34:01,960
can my son and I

350
00:34:02,559 --> 00:34:03,920
finally leave?

351
00:34:04,319 --> 00:34:05,079
Yes.

352
00:34:09,360 --> 00:34:10,719
Can you untie

353
00:34:10,960 --> 00:34:12,000
the rope on my feet?

354
00:34:12,519 --> 00:34:13,159
Sure.

355
00:34:14,119 --> 00:34:16,360
They'll be untied
once we see the 300,000 taels of gold.

356
00:34:19,360 --> 00:34:20,519
To retrieve the gold,

357
00:34:21,360 --> 00:34:23,079
these men of yours aren't enough.

358
00:34:25,376 --> 00:34:27,110
Who would dare
cross the military guards?

359
00:34:28,840 --> 00:34:29,840
Back then,

360
00:34:30,559 --> 00:34:33,239
when 300,000 taels of gold
were hauled to Wusu Sea,

361
00:34:34,159 --> 00:34:36,000
there were eighteen of us,

362
00:34:36,639 --> 00:34:38,400
and we used a hundred camels.

363
00:34:52,760 --> 00:34:54,400
We didn't care

364
00:34:54,760 --> 00:34:57,079
about the Ming military guards at all.

365
00:34:57,599 --> 00:34:59,519
They didn't even care about me.

366
00:35:02,360 --> 00:35:03,239
Didn't care?

367
00:35:04,800 --> 00:35:06,559
Not one bit.

368
00:35:08,440 --> 00:35:10,320
You don't care about your own life?

369
00:35:17,400 --> 00:35:19,639
I only care about my son's life.

370
00:35:32,039 --> 00:35:33,400
What's your name?

371
00:35:37,360 --> 00:35:38,239
Don't ask.

372
00:35:39,840 --> 00:35:40,880
I don't want to know

373
00:35:41,239 --> 00:35:42,360
yours, either.

374
00:35:45,519 --> 00:35:46,800
I don't have a name.

375
00:35:49,559 --> 00:35:51,239
Bana calls me Seventeen.

376
00:35:51,960 --> 00:35:53,639
Bana is my father.

377
00:35:56,239 --> 00:35:57,239
Don't move.

378
00:35:58,880 --> 00:35:59,920
Don't move a muscle.

379
00:36:09,239 --> 00:36:10,440
My spear is very fast.

380
00:36:11,559 --> 00:36:12,679
Move again,

381
00:36:12,720 --> 00:36:14,688
and it'll pierce
right through your heart.

382
00:36:16,760 --> 00:36:17,719
Why?

383
00:36:18,599 --> 00:36:20,039
We don't even know each other.

384
00:36:25,559 --> 00:36:26,679
It's Deputy Yu's order.

385
00:36:28,352 --> 00:36:30,208
It's better that we
don't know each other.

386
00:36:30,384 --> 00:36:31,712
It makes my spear even faster.

387
00:40:29,440 --> 00:40:31,400
You bury Pingping here?

388
00:40:38,320 --> 00:40:39,360
May she rest in peace.

389
00:40:40,440 --> 00:40:41,400
Once someone's gone,

390
00:40:41,488 --> 00:40:43,296
it's all the same wherever they are.

391
00:40:47,599 --> 00:40:48,920
In the future,

392
00:40:49,440 --> 00:40:51,000
how are we going to tell her family?

393
00:40:58,400 --> 00:40:59,960
I am Pingping's family.

394
00:41:06,320 --> 00:41:07,679
Besides, what "future"?

395
00:41:09,719 --> 00:41:10,760
Only if we stay alive

396
00:41:10,800 --> 00:41:11,920
will there be a "future".

397
00:41:15,679 --> 00:41:18,079
As long as I'm around,
you will have a future.

398
00:41:24,719 --> 00:41:26,559
If you had arrived
a little later in the day,

399
00:41:26,880 --> 00:41:28,752
I wouldn't have
to suffer like this anymore.

400
00:41:32,079 --> 00:41:33,360
Look how nice it is for Pingping.

401
00:41:34,240 --> 00:41:35,440
All her troubles are gone.

402
00:41:38,336 --> 00:41:39,670
You should've said so earlier.

403
00:41:40,144 --> 00:41:42,256
I didn't want to go through
all this trouble either.

404
00:41:47,639 --> 00:41:48,920
Coming back this time,

405
00:41:50,079 --> 00:41:51,239
if it weren't for you...

406
00:41:51,320 --> 00:41:52,800
You wouldn't know what to do, right?

407
00:41:53,712 --> 00:41:54,840
You've said that already.

408
00:42:00,719 --> 00:42:02,079
What is Bancha burning?

409
00:42:04,760 --> 00:42:07,039
He wants to bury those jerks.

410
00:42:09,936 --> 00:42:11,510
He wouldn't burn all of them, right?

411
00:43:09,780 --> 00:43:12,620
(Preview of the Next Episode)

412
00:43:13,760 --> 00:43:15,480
Your guy was captured,

413
00:43:16,400 --> 00:43:18,360
yet you're rushing over to kill him?

414
00:43:20,000 --> 00:43:23,239
He wants to take Liangzhou Deputy
to the Right Chancellor's gold.

415
00:43:24,159 --> 00:43:25,000
He's gone!

416
00:43:26,000 --> 00:43:26,840
He's gone!

417
00:43:27,760 --> 00:43:28,599
He's gone!

418
00:43:28,599 --> 00:43:29,480
He left.

419
00:43:29,559 --> 00:43:30,400
Who's gone?

420
00:43:32,960 --> 00:43:33,840
Which of you

421
00:43:34,360 --> 00:43:36,280
is the Qin Demon of Mount Pingfeng?

422
00:43:36,281 --> 00:43:41,281
=Remnants of Gold=
